1) The Course class is the base class.

2) The OfferedCourse class is the derived class.

3) They are common information for all courses, so they only need to be defined once in Course.

4) It means OfferedCourse inherits the accessible methods and fields from Course.

5) Because OfferedCourse inherits those methods from Course.

6 0instructorName, location, and classTime.

7) They are private to protect the data and require getter and setter methods to access or change them.

8) It means OfferedCourse is a specialized type of Course and inherits its functionality.
